  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La regidora de Comprom&iacute;s a l&#39;Ajuntament de Vila-real i candidata a les eleccions al Parlament Europeu en la llista de Primavera Europea, M&ograve;nica &Agrave;lvaro, ha estat aquest diumenge al caf&eacute; Barleys d&#39;Onda en un acte de campanya.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0700.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Presentada pel coordinador de Comprom&iacute;s per Onda, Llu&iacute;s Pastor Catalan, M&ograve;nica &Agrave;lvaro ha comen&ccedil;at criticant la gesti&oacute; del PP a l&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda i despr&eacute;s ja ha passat a parlar de la import&agrave;ncia de les Eleccions Europees de diumenge 25 de maig, &quot;per a aconseguir una Europa m&eacute;s social&quot;. A la taula estava tamb&eacute; Emi Tirado Bodel&oacute;n, responsable de Comunicaci&oacute; de Comprom&iacute;s per Onda.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0699.jpg\" alt=\"img_0699\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0700.jpg\" alt=\"img_0700\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0701.jpg\" alt=\"img_0701\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0702.jpg\" alt=\"img_0702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0703.jpg\" alt=\"img_0703\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/actemonicaalvarocompromisonda/img_0704.jpg\" alt=\"img_0704\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
